    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle demons, upgrade your Hero, Unlock powerful abilities. too fuel your vengeful rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the carnage left by the lords of Hell,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish evil that has destroyed lands across unique biomes to take your revenge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/00194600133b2076e6582735c31fd0fb.avif?t=1750124032\" width=742 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Bosses with a Souls and Hades Inspired Combat System.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll to evade enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/e2b85780ac6fcb9ef4742ff5a27638a1.poster.avif?t=1750124032\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/e2b85780ac6fcb9ef4742ff5a27638a1.webm?t=1750124032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink health potions to heal.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/93bd8fd1d0e0ebebb254a0030fb4b65d.avif?t=1750124032\" width=742 height=290 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the defeated bosses abilities or equipment to take with you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/51b5e7edfd7e5788631c5e8ea98aa767.avif?t=1750124032\" width=742 height=290 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Loop:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls from fallen enemies to upgrade your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill bosses and choose one of their abilities or equipment to keep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Art Style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt-Shift Graphics.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle demons, upgrade your Hero, Unlock powerful abilities. too fuel your vengeful rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the carnage left by the lords of Hell,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish evil that has destroyed lands across unique biomes to take your revenge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/00194600133b2076e6582735c31fd0fb.avif?t=1750124032\" width=742 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Bosses with a Souls and Hades Inspired Combat System.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll to evade enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/e2b85780ac6fcb9ef4742ff5a27638a1.poster.avif?t=1750124032\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/e2b85780ac6fcb9ef4742ff5a27638a1.webm?t=1750124032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink health potions to heal.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/93bd8fd1d0e0ebebb254a0030fb4b65d.avif?t=1750124032\" width=742 height=290 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the defeated bosses abilities or equipment to take with you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452650/extras/51b5e7edfd7e5788631c5e8ea98aa767.avif?t=1750124032\" width=742 height=290 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Loop:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls from fallen enemies to upgrade your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill bosses and choose one of their abilities or equipment to keep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Art Style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt-Shift Graphics.</p>",
